Subject: Apple chain benchmark instrumentation for v1.0.15
Base-commit: 1eb7d6d16975cb08f72da1df3fc6fb5d8b08f519

Instrumentation only. The rendering-pending bridge uses the Android v1.0.15
Native_renderingPending engine predicate exactly:
engine.has_pending_document_edits() ||
layer_render::CanvasRenderer::has_pending_work(engine.backend()).
The Apple surface in this release tracks no submitted-but-not-completed frame
count. Canvas cadence and presentation trace rings are not such a counter.
The runner includes mechanical release API adapters and the benchmark photo,
save, transform and resume fixes from bench-apple-codex.

Capped stroke metrics remain null while the existing settle barrier drains work
before subsequent steps.

Unnamed strokes restore the opened document paint layer before selecting the
brush, matching the Android chain target mapping.

